/* 极简风格主题样式 */
* {
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

body {
  font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
  line-height: 1.7;
  color: #333;
  background: #fff;
}

.container {
  max-width: 720px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 0 20px;
}

/* Header */
.site-header {
  padding: 2rem 0;
  border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;
  margin-bottom: 2rem;
}

.site-title {
  font-size: 1.8rem;
  font-weight: 700;
}

.site-title a {
  color: #333;
  text-decoration: none;
}

.site-nav {
  margin-top: 0.5rem;
}

.site-nav a {
  margin-right: 1rem;
  color: #555;
  text-decoration: none;
}

.site-nav a:hover {
  color: #000;
}

/* 文章列表 */
.post-item {
  margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
}

.post-title {
  font-size: 1.5rem;
}

.post-title a {
  color: #333;
  text-decoration: none;
}

.post-title a:hover {
  text-decoration: underline;
}

.post-date {
  display: block;
  color: #999;
  font-size: 0.9rem;
  margin: 0.2rem 0 0.5rem;
}

.post-excerpt {
  color: #555;
  max-height: 5.2em;
  overflow: hidden;
  display: -webkit-box;
  -webkit-line-clamp: 3;
  -webkit-box-orient: vertical;
}

/* 文章页 */
.post-content,
.page-content {
  margin-top: 1rem;
}

.post-content img,
.page-content img {
  max-width: 100%;
}

.post-content pre,
.page-content pre {
  background: #f6f8fa;
  padding: 1rem;
  overflow-x: auto;
}

.post-content code,
.page-content code {
  background: #f6f8fa;
  padding: 0.2em 0.4em;
}

.post-content pre code,
.page-content pre code {
  padding: 0;
}

/* 归档 */
.archive h1 {
  margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
}

.archive-item {
  margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
}

.archive-item time {
  color: #999;
  margin-right: 0.75rem;
}

.archive-item a {
  color: #333;
  text-decoration: none;
}

.archive-item a:hover {
  text-decoration: underline;
}

/* 分页 */
.pagination {
  margin: 2rem 0;
}

.pagination a {
  color: #333;
  background: #f6f8fa;
  padding: 0.3rem 0.8rem;
  border-radius: 4px;
  text-decoration: none;
}

.pagination a:hover {
  background: #eee;
}

/* Footer */
.site-footer {
  border-top: 1px solid #eee;
  margin-top: 3rem;
  padding: 1.5rem 0;
  color: #999;
  font-size: 0.9rem;
  text-align: center;
}

/* 响应式 */
@media (max-width: 600px) {
  .site-header {
    padding: 1rem 0;
  }

  .post-title {
    font-size: 1.3rem;
  }
}

## 三、切换主题（修改根目录配置）

修改站点根目录下的 `_config.yml`，找到：

theme: 当前主题名

改为：

theme: minimalist

这样便切换到了新主题，原主题目录仍然保留在 `themes/` 中，不会受影响。

